    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people care but it doesn't change the reality of my day to day. it doesn't make the weight any lighter. it feels like no matter what i do, i'm just drowning in responsibilities that i never asked for. i feel like i'm just a ghost in my own house, just serving everyone else until there's nothing left of me. i'm just so tired of fighting to stay afloat when i'm already so far gone.",
